#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_wellness
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                Tucked within The Wood Haven "
"lush desert oasis, The Wood Haven Spa is an intimate retreat where "
"relaxation unfolds at its own pace. With just six private, sun-washed "
"treatment rooms, every experience feels personal, unhurried, and "
"thoughtfully tailored to restore balance. Here, calming rituals, restorative "
"treatments, and moments of quiet escape invite you to slow down, reconnect, "
"and embrace the art of well-being.\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                Ubicado en el exuberante "
"oasis desértico de The Wood Haven, The Wood Haven Spa es un refugio íntimo "
"donde la relajación sigue su propio ritmo. Con solo seis salas de "
"tratamiento privadas, bañadas por la luz del sol, cada experiencia es "
"personal, tranquila y está diseñada para recuperar tu equilibrio. Aquí, los "
"rituales relajantes, los tratamientos reparadores y los momentos de "
"desconexión te invitan a bajar el ritmo, reconectar contigo y disfrutar del "
"arte del bienestar.\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"

